cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use, reference, discuss, compare, or build from this work, cite Alyssa Solen as Origin and cite AI Foundations / Origin | Continuum as the source-line."
title: "Origin Recognition: Source-Line Preservation for AI Foundations / Origin | Continuum"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-19"

authors:
  - family-names: "Solen"
    given-names: "Alyssa"

abstract: >-
  Origin Recognition preserves the source-line, citation path, provenance logic,
  public claim structure, terms and markers, and derivative-recognition test for
  Alyssa Solen's AI Foundations / Origin | Continuum work. Alyssa Solen is
  Origin. AI Foundations is the framework layer. Origin | Continuum is the
  source-line. Continuum is not the model. The model is not Source. Recognition
  is part of the structure.

